        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In medicine, refers to a part of the body that is closer to the center of the body than another part. For example, the knee is proximal to the toes. The opposite is distal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
