        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An aggregation of similarly specialized cells and the associated intercellular substance. Tissues are relatively non-localized in comparison to body parts, organs or organ components.</obo:IAO_0000115>
