        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cartilage (tissue) which consists of chondrocytes and collagen, the intercellular matrix of which is an amorphous gel with a perichondrium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
