        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A strong ligament of the knee that originates from the anterolateral surface of the medial condyle of the femur, passes posteriorly and inferiorly between the condyles, and attaches to the posterior intercondylar area of the tibia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
