        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Application of electric current in treatment without the generation of perceptible heat. It includes electric stimulation of nerves or muscles, passage of current into the body, or use of interrupted current of low intensity to raise the threshold of the skin to pain.</owl:annotatedTarget>
