        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Interferential therapy (IFT) is a type of physical therapy. It uses a mid-frequency electrical signal to treat muscular spasms and strains.</obo:IAO_0000115>
