        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A lunge can refer to any position of the human body where one leg is positioned forward with knee bent and foot flat on the ground while the other leg is positioned behind.</obo:IAO_0000115>
