        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An inflammatory process affecting a joint. Causes include infection, autoimmune processes, degenerative processes, and trauma. Signs and symptoms may include swelling around the affected joint and pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
