        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A degeneration of the ARTICULAR CARTILAGE of the PATELLA, caused by a decrease in sulfated MUCOPOLYSACCHARIDES in the ground substance. When accompanied by pain, it is sometimes considered part of or confused with PATELLOFEMORAL PAIN SYNDROME.</obo:IAO_0000115>
