        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Health care services provided to patients on an ambulatory basis, rather than by admission to a hospital or other health care facility. The services may be a part of a hospital, augmenting its inpatient services, or may be provided at a free-standing facility.</obo:IAO_0000115>
