        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An exaggerated alteration of lateral trunk movements, with an exaggerated elevation of the hip, suggesting the gait of a duck.</obo:IAO_0000115>
