        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Start position: Stand upright. Action: Bend the knees, jump upwards and land with equal weight on both legs. Variations: on an uneven or unstable surface; catching and throwing a ball; increasing height; increasing knee bend; altering trunk position.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">trak</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
