        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">International Knee Documentation Committee (IKDC) subjective knee evaluation form is a knee-specific measure of symptoms, function, and sports activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
