        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A 7-item measure of physical function derived from the function, daily living and function, sports and recreational activity subscales of the KOOS. It measures people&apos;s opinions about the difficulties they experience with activity due to problems with their knee.</owl:annotatedTarget>
