        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lysholm knee scoring scale is a scoring scale for knee ligament surgery follow-up emphasizing evaluation of symptoms of instability, which is defined as &apos;giving way&apos; during activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
