        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A rating system for patients undergoing knee arthroplasty that rates only the knee joint itself and a functional score that rates the patient&apos;s ability to walk and climb stairs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
