        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Squash is a high-speed racquet sport played by two players (or in doubles 4 players on court at a time) in a four-walled court with a small, hollow rubber ball.</obo:IAO_0000115>
