        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Distal portion of the leg upon which one stands and walks. In humans it consists of the tarsus, metatarsus, and phalanges and the tissues encompassing them.</obo:IAO_0000115>
