        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The discus throw is an event in track and field athletics competition, in which an athlete throws a heavy disc in an attempt to mark a farther distance than his or her competitors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
