        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Start position: Stand upright with feet apart. Action: Squat down keeping the spine in a neutral position, pick up the weights from the floor, straighten the knees and hips to an upright position.</obo:IAO_0000115>
