        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Start position: Lie down or sit upright with legs straight out in front. Action: Bend the affected knee as much as possible and apply pressure to the front of the affected leg to bend the knee more. This can be done using elastic resistance, a towel or hands.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">trak</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
