        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Start position: Lie on either side with knees bent and the upper body raised off the ground by resting on a flexed elbow and forearm. Action: Engage pelvic floor and lower abdominal muscles. Press through your supporting arm and straighten legs to lift your pelvis off the ground, to make a straight line between your shoulders, pelvis and legs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">trak</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
